        "original_id": "7c35bb51-675a-52bc-b760-6abf109d56a0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Trace Cyrus, Jizzy Pearl, Noah Cyrus, Tish Cyrus, Billy Ray Cyrus, Miley Cyrus\n- Bands: Ashland HIGH, Quiet Riot, Love/Hate\n- Roles: vocalist, guitarist, lead vocalist\n\nFacts:\n- Jizzy Pearl, born James Wilkinson, was born on March 17, 1958, in Chicago, Illinois, and is an American vocalist.\n- In 2010, Trace Cyrus began providing vocals and guitar in the pop rock band Ashland HIGH.\n- In November 2013, Love/Hate vocalist Jizzy Pearl joined Quiet Riot.\n- Jizzy Pearl performs lead vocals on the six studio tracks of Quiet Riot 10.\n- Noah Cyrus is the youngest daughter of Tish Cyrus and Billy Ray Cyrus.\n- Noah Cyrus is the younger sister of Miley Cyrus and Trace Cyrus.",
